<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 11 firms.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japan stock via 11 firms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through 11 foreign securities houses in Tokyo before the start of stock trading on Friday showed a net selling stance of 5.4 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors' sell orders totalled 20.5 million shares while buy orders amounted to 15.1 million.</p>
